+
+**Acceptance Criteria:**
+- Given the walk is finished, when Next is pressed on Signing Check, then the heading "Review" shows with "Step 8 of 8" (Import "6 of 6"), every applicable answer as text with its own Change, and Create wallet in the footer
+- Given a Change on any row, when its question renders, then the answer is as it was, and Next lands on the Review showing any edit
+- Given No Open Check, 30 seconds and a custom Node on Testnet, when Network is changed to Mainnet, then Open Check, auto-lock and Node are at their pre-selections, one visible polite status line names those three, and the Review shows the new values
+- Given only legal answers, when Network changes, then they are unchanged and no line shows
+- Given Passkey-Derived on an unbound address, when Network changes to Mainnet, then Seed Method is Stored, Signing Check is its pre-selection, the Passkey-Derived option stays visible and `aria-disabled` with its reason, and both resets are named
+- Given any Network change, then no selected answer is unavailable under `describeOptions` for the new Network (the exhaustive test fails otherwise)
+- Given the Review, when Create wallet is pressed, then the call matches step 2's for the same answers, and a refusing policy blocks it before any keystore call
+- Given first-run Onboarding and the chooser's add screen, then the Review and the reset behave identically
